{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u23f9\ufe0e\u00a0Game Description\u00a0\u23f9\ufe0e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a fun dungeon exploration RPG game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, &quot;Memelis,&quot; heads to the dungeon in search of treasure to pay off her debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, she will encounter fearsome monsters and heartwarming companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will she be able to find the treasure and clear her debts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e\u00a0Game Features\u00a0\u23f9\ufe0e</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A classic Japanese-style RPG adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich dungeon maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fun and absurd storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can earn money not just by treasure hunting, but through various other ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e Characters \u23f9\ufe0e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490890/extras/chara01_EN.jpg?t=1741060998\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6\u00a0Memelis<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u25c0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To her, a full card deck is better than a full belly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490890/extras/chara02_EN.jpg?t=1741060998\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6\u00a0Tina<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u25c0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The serious childhood playmate, the great Saintess.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490890?t=1741060998","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490890/c789bae8544